WEBVTT

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:07.580
As we cast our eyes above to the boundless sky, we know

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:15.630
Whatever tomorrow brings, the sun will always shine

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:19.720
So won't you come with me?

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:36.780
It's almost time for the school bell to ring

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:38.990
And every moment by moment

00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:41.410
I feel more and more like I could fly

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:44.870
This feeling fills my thoughts and sets my heart alight

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:48.330
It's this moment I love most of all

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.000
In my bag I hold all the things I've overcome

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.760
And on their wings, I'll fly into the future

00:00:56.760 --> 00:01:01.260
We can do anything, at any time and any place

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:04.770
And no one can stop us even if they try

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:09.400
From ING and that alone can we proceed

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:13.320
Carrying all our feelings as we go

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:17.320
Flying with our dreams for all to see

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:23.790
Let's close today's chapter, and start a new page!

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:34.370
Okay! Okay! Okay!

00:01:34.370 --> 00:01:39.250
Okay! Okay! Okay! Okay!

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:42.000
Looks like it'll be done soon.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.920
The entrance is coming along on schedule.

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:44.830
What the hell?!

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:46.000
You're supposed to hold it!

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:48.000
We're stuck.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.260
What are you guys doing?!

00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:52.180
Hold it upright! You trying to break it?!

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:53.470
Sorry...

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:15.030
Hey, stop that!

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:16.370
You're gonna break it! Hey!

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:22.290
Huh? Is there a problem?

00:02:22.710 --> 00:02:24.540
What does it look like?!

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:26.540
That's right.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:30.260
Don't destroy the arch until the real show begins.

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:31.010
What?!

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:33.010
Good point.

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:34.260
Down we go...

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:38.600
You sure it's fine letting her off like that?

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:40.560
It <i>is</i> the Seishou School Fair.

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:45.190
What are you doing?!

00:02:45.650 --> 00:02:48.690
I'm so excited.

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:49.940
Come again?

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:52.190
Let's work hard together.

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:57.240
It's our job to be sure that everyone makes good memories today!

00:02:57.240 --> 00:03:00.160
This school is ridiculous.

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:08.080
What's your class going to do?

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:10.340
Looks like we're doing a maid cafe.

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:12.380
That'll be fun!

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:15.760
They're all modern young girls, after all...

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:19.300
Welcome back, Master.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:23.140
We're going to do whatever you desire today.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:24.600
Come on, tell me.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:26.560
What desire of yours can I fulfill?

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:27.690
Don't be shy.

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:29.770
Uh, well...

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:31.400
Go over the material for class.

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:33.030
Sir! Yes, Sir!

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:35.450
Make sure you do your homework!

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:37.360
Sir! Yes, Sir!

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:38.990
Brush your teeth before bed!

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:40.780
Sir! Yes, Sir!

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:42.830
That'd be nice...

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:44.080
Is something wrong?

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:45.750
No, nothing.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.380
How's everything coming along?

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:56.420
Hey, Kouhei.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:57.510
Where are FNC and the others?

00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:59.590
They're out buying stuff!

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:01.550
All of them?

00:04:02.310 --> 00:04:05.600
I've been looking everywhere for this!

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:07.310
What's it doing here?

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:10.610
He only shows up at the Seishou School Fair.

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:14.530
What's more, all his goods are super-rare.

00:04:15.030 --> 00:04:17.530
He is the mysterious merchant, Flower.

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:24.040
Th-This is something only SOCOM and the 10th Mountain Division have...

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:26.330
The AN/PSQ-20!

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:28.750
How much is this, dude?!

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:30.710
Don't call me "dude".

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:31.500
Then, Curly!

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:33.090
I'm not Curly!

00:04:33.090 --> 00:04:34.750
I'm Flower!

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.010
Whatever.

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:38.090
Not gonna say a thing. More trouble than he's worth.

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:42.430
Sixteen-chan, don't bother with places like this. We need to go shopping.

00:04:42.430 --> 00:04:44.010
It's fine. Elle's having fun, too.

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:49.020
See? Everyone's having fun.

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:50.980
Come on, Funko, you too. Pick something out.

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:52.400
But...

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:53.650
How about this?!

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:57.860
That looks good on you, Funko-chan!

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.200
Y-You really think so?

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:00.780
Yeah, it looks great!

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:02.620
Maybe I should try a different color.

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:04.120
Yeah.

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:06.870
You have to snap up stuff like this the moment you see it.

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:08.450
But, how much is it?

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:14.380
Well, it's cheap for what you're getting...

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:16.050
Elle-chan!

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:18.800
Don't worry about it.

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:21.720
You're buying quite a lot...

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:23.220
You sure you can afford it?

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:24.180
Look at this!

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:27.250
War funds!

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:28.560
You can't!

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:30.060
That's for the class!

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:32.480
You can't just do whatever you want, you know!

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:33.600
Yeah, but...

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:36.610
We don't know when we'll ever find this stuff again!

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:37.280
Yeah.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:40.950
Exactly. They're pretty rare.

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:42.780
I might not have them next time.

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:48.790
Sometimes, a girl just has to put her foot down!

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:50.750
And this is that—

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:54.710
You guys...

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:56.960
What are you doing?!

00:05:58.340 --> 00:06:00.010
The PSQ-20!

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:04.390
The PSQ-20 is begging me to buy her!

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:07.720
See you next year!

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:11.730
I thought you were going out shopping?

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:13.640
We were going to, but...

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:14.810
Jeez.

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:16.520
I can't let you guys out of my sight.

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:18.900
You can't just go wasting the class's money.

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:21.150
Sorry about that...

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:24.160
Do you guys really think your maid cafe will be ready at this rate?

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:26.780
I think they've learned their lesson.

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:31.290
Don't slack off just because I'm checking up on everyone else.

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:38.090
Oh, wonderful!

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:39.090
What's going on?

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:47.260
This is a classroom?

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:51.520
A camel farm?

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:54.100
What an interesting idea!

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:57.060
We got the camels straight from Israel.

00:06:57.770 --> 00:06:58.650
Damn it!

00:06:58.650 --> 00:07:01.030
I brought it over. Aren't I a good girl?

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:02.110
Yes, you are.

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:03.860
Eighteen told me I'm a good girl.

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:07.370
It stinks...

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:09.910
Was the classroom always this big?

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:14.540
H-Hey, that wall over there! The wall!

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:18.000
Make it bigger!

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.460
You smashed it open?!

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:21.050
Why'd you do that?!

00:07:22.340 --> 00:07:24.920
How creative! A wonderful idea!

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:25.840
Huh? What are you saying?

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:27.890
This <i>is</i> the Seishou School Fair.

00:07:27.890 --> 00:07:29.220
It's hard to walk...

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:31.260
This kinda place would be a hellish combat zone.

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:33.020
Wait!

00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:34.270
No!

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:37.270
How do you ride one of these?

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:41.230
You guys!

00:07:44.070 --> 00:07:46.900
We tried to replicate the heat.

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:47.860
Ow, hot!

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:50.070
Let's take a picture.

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:52.370
All right! I'm gonna take it now!

00:07:52.370 --> 00:07:53.080
One, two...

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:56.080
Quit playing around! Get to work!

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:02.920
All right. We're done.

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:05.050
Good job, G3.

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:08.260
No one will even realize it's her!

00:08:11.890 --> 00:08:13.430
All right. Here we go.

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:14.600
There!

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:22.110
Wow, optical camouflage is amazing.

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:25.400
There are eight processors running in parallel,

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:28.700
and they can project the surrounding environment in real time.

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:32.490
It's too soon to be impressed.

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:33.080
There!

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:33.530
Huh?

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:35.870
Sensei!

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:37.540
Huh?

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:41.920
What?!

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:43.920
What do you think? You can see right through them, can't you?

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:47.420
I-Idiot! Put some clothes on!

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:48.510
What are you talking about?

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:51.390
Clothes! Clothes! Put on some clothes!

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:54.640
What's the matter?

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:59.600
What's he doing?

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:04.150
Are they even taking this seriously?

00:09:04.150 --> 00:09:05.570
It'll be fine.

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:08.490
How's it going? Make any progress?

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:11.320
Shouldn't you be preparing the cafe?!

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:13.280
We are.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:14.160
Check this out.

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:18.000
What jungle is that supposed to be?!

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:20.290
Oh, we scrapped that. This is the real one.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:22.960
An art exhibit?

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:24.210
We scrapped that one too!

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:25.750
Speak for yourself.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:27.800
It ended up like this.

00:09:29.510 --> 00:09:31.720
Thank goodness...

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:34.600
Wait, it doesn't look like anything's been done here!

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:36.430
What are you talking about, Sensei?

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:38.470
We just finalized the menu.

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:39.520
Huh? The menu?

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:43.850
Since you're here, why don't you sample it?

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:45.400
Here's my personal recommendation.

00:09:46.150 --> 00:09:47.110
What's this?

00:09:47.110 --> 00:09:49.150
It's pineapple pie.

00:09:49.490 --> 00:09:51.320
What's up with the color?

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.450
We replicated the grenade's hardness,

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:56.160
its smell, and even its internals.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:59.450
I-It's not going to explode, is it?

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:02.000
If it did, you couldn't eat it.

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:06.670
It's easier to eat now, don't you think?

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:09.380
It's good.

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:11.470
This is the dish I recommend.

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:13.300
I'm quite proud of it.

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:14.930
You can get different options with it.

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:18.470
Darts?

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:26.610
There!

00:10:26.610 --> 00:10:27.110
Take this!

00:10:28.820 --> 00:10:30.280
Bullseye!

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:33.030
This is a Taiwanese fruit sauce that Tei brought.

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:35.070
And this is the Hacchou miso

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:37.240
that Eighteen0chan brought from her hometown.

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:39.290
Pancakes...

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:40.200
and miso?

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.200
I recommend it!

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:47.540
What's going on?

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:51.260
You'll definitely need these.

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:52.260
Yeah.

00:10:52.550 --> 00:10:53.550
What are these?

00:10:53.550 --> 00:10:55.010
Rations.

00:10:55.010 --> 00:10:56.010
Rations?

00:10:56.010 --> 00:11:00.600
They're military foodstuffs designed to have a long shelf life and to be a good source of calories.

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:03.230
Nice, isn't it?

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:05.060
It's steak and beef stew.

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:06.520
We've got everything here.

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:09.320
Back in my day, they used to eat canned food all the time.

00:11:09.320 --> 00:11:11.150
It looks pretty real, but...

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:13.610
Give it a try.

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:18.990
This is pretty good!

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:22.370
They've really improved that one, so it's quite popular.

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:25.460
We could also give people cocoa.

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:27.540
I've got plenty of chocolate.

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:29.420
This is surprisingly good.

00:11:29.420 --> 00:11:31.250
Let me try some of that, too.

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:35.380
I don't think you should.

00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:37.510
Huh?

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:41.640
We've finalized the menu now.

00:11:41.640 --> 00:11:44.020
Everyone, look over here!

00:11:48.980 --> 00:11:51.150
What have you been doing, Fountainhead?

00:11:51.150 --> 00:11:52.320
I'm not a fountain!

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:55.190
I was making our uniforms.

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:58.030
Here's a chance for you to win Funko over, Aug.

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:04.910
I-I can't! Funko-sama is watching.

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.250
You look cute, Aug-chan.

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:11.250
No!

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:12.800
This again?

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:14.550
What's wrong with her?

00:12:14.550 --> 00:12:15.800
No clue.

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:17.170
I'll be wearing this!

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.340
Ta-da!

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:22.510
Wow!

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:24.720
It's the latest A-TACS!

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:25.980
That's not all!

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:30.520
The underwear matches, too!

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:32.190
No one sees it, but that's just why it's gotta be right!

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:35.610
You've coordinated everything.

00:12:35.610 --> 00:12:38.280
Models sure are different.

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:40.990
Stop playing around. Hurry up and get ready!

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:42.910
How nice...

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:44.950
Sensei.

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:48.580
I'm up next.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:50.580
It might be a little too short, though.

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:52.750
Don't you have anything more normal?!

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:54.630
Wh-What do you think?

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:59.510
Yes. That's exactly how a maid should look.

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:02.090
Elle-chan put it together for me.

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:04.390
It's a little bit too big.

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:11.810
Wow! That's perfect!

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:13.770
Boobs don't make the girl...

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:16.150
It's show time!

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:22.410
Wh-What do you think?

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:27.870
What are you doing, Sensei?!

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:44.800
This is more like a battlefield than a school fair.

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.390
How nice!

00:13:46.390 --> 00:13:51.600
It's a little different from how I'd picture a normal school fair...

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:56.520
It's perfectly normal if you just view it as the students enjoying their youth.

00:13:57.940 --> 00:13:58.690
What was that?

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:00.570
Oh no, I missed!

00:14:00.570 --> 00:14:02.360
But I feel better now.

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:03.660
Is something going on over there?

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:06.530
The Seishou School Fair tradition.

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:11.750
G-Garland-sensei?!

00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:17.420
Take this, Sensei!

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:22.130
What are you doing?!

00:14:23.260 --> 00:14:25.050
I-It's fine!

00:14:26.100 --> 00:14:27.050
B-But you screamed?

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:28.810
No, I didn't!

00:14:28.810 --> 00:14:30.310
<i>I'm pretty sure I heard you scream...</i>

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:35.100
"Garland's Close Call" is famous at the Seishou School Fair.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:37.270
It's going to be really crowded tomorrow,

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:38.770
so give it a try now!

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:40.650
Here you go.

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:41.990
I'm fine.

00:14:41.990 --> 00:14:46.200
If he jumps out of the barrel in time, it won't hurt, so it's all good.

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:48.120
But won't it hurt if he messes up?!

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:50.040
Now, show me what you're made of!

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:53.410
No hard feelings, right?

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:11.310
Good work!

00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:12.310
Hey, no fair!

00:15:16.980 --> 00:15:19.520
So, how is it, Japanese Teacher?

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:23.030
How is it? What the hell's going on here?

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:27.070
Everyone's doing just great.

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.200
Huh?

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:31.540
There are more classes doing more complex things this year.

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:32.370
Huh?!

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:34.080
There've been very few casualties, too.

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:35.080
What?!

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:45.300
I brought you your portion.

00:15:45.300 --> 00:15:46.300
Oh, good work.

00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:04.570
I guess this is normal here...

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:06.530
We got a lot of work done!

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:09.660
All that work has made me really hungry.

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:11.490
You didn't eat that long ago.

00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:14.620
Okay, chow down.

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:15.410
Okay!

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:18.170
Thank you, Fal-neechan.

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:21.130
I figured you guys would be hungry.

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:24.840
I was surprised at how much you got done.

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:25.800
We're just <i>that</i> good.

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:30.430
What should I eat next?

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:31.390
Here.

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:33.470
You can have this.

00:16:33.890 --> 00:16:34.890
Soda?

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:36.560
And one more thing.

00:16:36.560 --> 00:16:38.390
Why an orange?

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:42.650
'Cause <i>orange</i> you glad I gave you something to drink?

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:47.280
You best be jokin'.

00:16:47.780 --> 00:16:48.700
What did you say?

00:16:52.120 --> 00:16:53.660
No, don't, Sixteen-chan!

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:54.790
Fourteen, you too!

00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:56.620
You'll lose the nickname you love so much.

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:59.080
You're lucky I didn't kill you!

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:01.080
Um...

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:04.340
What are you guys doing for the fair?

00:17:04.340 --> 00:17:06.090
A staple of every school fair:

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:07.260
a haunted house.

00:17:07.590 --> 00:17:09.590
It's pretty scary.

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:12.390
Fal and G3's makeup looks great.

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:13.970
What are you dressing as?

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:15.760
Zombies, of course.

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:17.100
Zombies?

00:17:24.570 --> 00:17:25.730
Sounds scary...

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:28.610
I see! And then you shoot at them, right?

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:30.110
It's not a game...

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:32.110
Zombies are meant for shooting!

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:34.990
I get to shoot Fourteen as much as I please...

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:36.830
Awesome.

00:17:40.210 --> 00:17:41.750
Go to hell!

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:42.830
What?!

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:44.420
Calm down!

00:17:44.420 --> 00:17:46.550
Fourteen, stop it!

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:53.760
Oh, no...

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:55.260
Look what I did...

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:57.430
I'm sorry!

00:17:57.430 --> 00:18:00.350
I just got so into it...

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:02.900
Oh well. This is what usually happens.

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:07.150
We were supposed to get tons of customers and make our project a success.

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:09.480
But we won't make it in time now.

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:10.820
Don't give up!

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:13.160
Sensei?!

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:14.780
We still have time!

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:16.370
Don't give up so easily!

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:18.580
It's already evening.

00:18:18.580 --> 00:18:21.460
Then what was the point of working so hard?

00:18:21.460 --> 00:18:23.370
Don't let yourselves believe something's impossible.

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:25.250
I believe in you guys.

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:27.630
So you guys should believe in yourselves, too.

00:18:27.630 --> 00:18:28.250
You'll make it!

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:29.760
Sensei...

00:18:30.090 --> 00:18:33.010
You guys can pull it off.

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:39.010
I'd like permission for some students to stay overnight!

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:40.430
Sure.

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:43.980
Thank you.

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:52.780
Youth is a wonderful thing.

00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:56.700
I've gotten permission to stay on campus overnight!

00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:58.620
Thank you, Sensei!

00:18:58.620 --> 00:18:59.620
Now...

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:07.830
SG550's team will work on the outfits.

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:08.960
Right!

00:19:09.590 --> 00:19:11.630
FNC's team will prepare the tableware.

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:12.800
Right!

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:14.680
M16's team will clean the floor.

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:15.630
Right!

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:18.140
L85A1 team will...

00:19:19.350 --> 00:19:21.310
get the flowers ready.

00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:21.810
Right!

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:24.350
We're about to walk into a battlefield.

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:25.810
Stay focused!

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:27.560
Yes, Sensei!

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:44.000
Change of plan.

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:46.500
M16's team will move the tables.

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:48.960
FNC's team will decorate the tables.

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:53.090
SG550's and L85A1's teams will continue their work.

00:19:53.090 --> 00:19:54.210
Sir! Yes, Sir!

00:19:54.720 --> 00:19:56.220
<i>Everyone's working as a team...</i>

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:58.300
<i>This just might work.</i>

00:19:58.550 --> 00:19:59.930
Let's do this!

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:10.900
We'll take it from here!

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:12.900
Elle-chan, that looks amazing!

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:15.240
All right! Here I go!

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:20.950
<i>Looks like we're somehow going to make it.</i>

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:28.080
We'll make it! Keep it up, everyone!

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:29.540
Sir! Yes, Sir!

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:30.880
I believe in you all!

00:20:30.880 --> 00:20:32.630
Sir! Yes, Sir!

00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:40.840
Are you okay?

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:42.010
Need to go to the nurse's office?

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:52.810
<i>I guess everyone's reaching their limit...</i>

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:54.570
<i>There's only a little bit more to do.</i>

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:57.820
We're back!

00:20:57.820 --> 00:20:59.950
Our student council work took a while.

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:01.620
Perfect timing!

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:02.410
We were waiting for you!

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:07.120
Use this to make a sign.

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:08.960
I'll let you get away with this today, AUGA1!

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:13.170
You sure about this, Japanese Teacher?

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:16.210
This is Aug's long version.

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:18.300
Keep your eyes open and watch closely!

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:22.010
Watch out, Funko!
Enemy attack?!

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:26.260
Do it over!

00:21:27.520 --> 00:21:30.190
This year's fair has a different feel to it.

00:21:30.770 --> 00:21:32.650
Well, someone new has joined after all.

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:35.230
I won't lose, either!

00:21:47.580 --> 00:21:49.200
Two customers!

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:50.370
'Sup!

00:21:50.710 --> 00:21:52.920
That's not what you're supposed to say...

00:21:55.670 --> 00:21:59.050
Welcome to 2-A's maid cafe.

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:06.970
Let's tear another page off our calendar

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:14.480
Together we braved

00:22:18.940 --> 00:22:26.450
past ages and never-ending conflict

00:22:26.700 --> 00:22:34.080
Together we laughed and cried in those hectic times

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:39.670
When I ran

00:22:42.590 --> 00:22:53.100
I put my footsteps into the ground

00:22:54.140 --> 00:23:00.820
Let's tear another page off our calendar

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:07.990
Something is bound to change

00:23:09.410 --> 00:23:16.170
One by one the days I tore off pile up

00:23:16.670 --> 00:23:20.050
like a past I cannot erase

00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:26.220
They will be my strength for days to come

00:23:30.850 --> 00:23:32.310
In the blink of an eye, it's summer!

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:34.140
I love Funko-chan in her swimsuit.

00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:35.310
What's the meaning of youth?

00:23:35.520 --> 00:23:36.390
Not giving up?

00:23:36.690 --> 00:23:38.360
Next time: Burn Up! Get Mad!

00:23:38.690 --> 00:23:40.690
Love.
